<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>FinHub BD — Community for Accounting & Finance Professionals</title>
<meta name="description" content="A free, vetted community for accountants, finance professionals and students in Bangladesh. Learn AI tools, connect with peers, grow your career.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@500;700;800&family=Hind+Siliguri:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f2f6f3;--surface:#ffffff;--ink:#0f241f;--muted:#4b625b;--line:#cfdcd5;--brand:#0b7a63;--brand-ink:#ffffff;--mark:#f4c14f;--mark-ink:#3a2b00;color-scheme:light;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#0c1a17;--surface:#12261f;--ink:#e8f3ee;--muted:#9bb5ab;--line:#244137;--brand:#3fcfa9;--brand-ink:#04251c;--mark:#f4c14f;--mark-ink:#3a2b00;color-scheme:dark}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0c1a17;--surface:#12261f;--ink:#e8f3ee;--muted:#9bb5ab;--line:#244137;--brand:#3fcfa9;--brand-ink:#04251c;color-scheme:dark}
html{scroll-padding-top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top,0px) + 64px);scroll-behavior:smooth}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.65 "Hind Siliguri",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque","Hind Siliguri",system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.1;margin:0 0 .5em;letter-spacing:-.02em}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,6vw,4.1rem);font-weight:800}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.6vw,2.5rem);font-weight:700}
h3{font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em}
p{margin:0 0 1em;color:var(--muted);max-width:62ch}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
section{padding:72px 0}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;height:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);background:var(--bg);z-index:30}
header{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:20;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:60px;gap:16px}
.logo{font:800 1.25rem "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.logo b{background:var(--mark);color:var(--mark-ink);padding:0 6px;border-radius:4px;margin-left:2px}
nav{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center}
nav a{text-decoration:none;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted)}
nav a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--brand);color:var(--brand-ink);font:600 1rem "Hind Siliguri",sans-serif;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid var(--brand)}
.btn.alt{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink)}
.btn:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--mark);outline-offset:3px}
.hero{padding:64px 0 56px}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:44px;align-items:center}
.hero p{font-size:1.15rem}
.hl{background:linear-gradient(transparent 62%,var(--mark) 62%)}
.cta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:26px 0 20px}
.facts{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted)}
.facts span::before{content:"✓ ";color:var(--brand);font-weight:700}
.ledger{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;font-size:.9rem}
.ledger header{position:static;background:var(--brand);color:var(--brand-ink);padding:10px 16px;font:700 .95rem "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;border:0}
.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 64px 64px;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.row:first-of-type{border-top:0}
.row.h{color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}
.row span:nth-child(n+2){text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.row.t{background:var(--bg);font-weight:600}
.row.ok span:first-child::after{content:" ✓";color:var(--brand)}
.ledger small{display:block;padding:10px 16px;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.grid{display:grid;gap:18px}
.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
.card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:24px}
.card p{margin:0;font-size:.98rem}
.alt-bg{background:var(--surface);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.alt-bg .card{background:var(--bg)}
.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center}
.avatar{width:200px;height:200px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--brand-ink);display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 3.4rem "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif}
.tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}
.tools span{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:99px;font-size:.92rem}
.steps{counter-reset:s;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
.steps .card{counter-increment:s;position:relative;padding-top:34px}
.steps .card::before{content:counter(s);position:absolute;top:-16px;left:22px;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mark);color:var(--mark-ink);display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 1rem "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif}
details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0}
summary{cursor:pointer;font:600 1.08rem "Hind Siliguri",sans-serif;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
summary::after{content:"+";font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1;color:var(--brand);transition:transform .2s}
details[open] summary::after{transform:rotate(45deg)}
details p{margin:10px 0 0}
.final{background:var(--brand);color:var(--brand-ink);text-align:center;border-radius:14px;padding:56px 24px}
.final p{color:inherit;margin:0 auto 24px;opacity:.9}
.final .btn{background:var(--mark);color:var(--mark-ink);border-color:var(--mark)}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
footer a{margin-right:16px;text-decoration:none}
@media (max-width:860px){
.hero-grid,.about{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.g3,.g4,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
nav a:not(.btn){display:none}
.avatar{width:120px;height:120px;font-size:2.2rem}
section{padding:56px 0}}
@media (max-width:560px){.g3,.g4,.g2,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steps{gap:30px}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap nav">
<a class="logo" href="#top">Fin<b>Hub</b> BD</a>
<nav><a href="#benefits">Benefits</a><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a class="btn join" href="#">Join free</a></nav>
</div></header>

<main id="top">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div>
<p style="margin-bottom:10px"><strong style="color:var(--brand)">Now accepting members. Free to join.</strong></p>
<h1>Where Bangladesh’s accounting & finance people <span class="hl">learn AI together</span>.</h1>
<p>FinHub BD is a free, vetted community for accountants, finance professionals and students. Learn AI tools, share real workflows, find opportunities and grow your career with peers.</p>
<div class="cta"><a class="btn join" href="#">Join the community</a><a class="btn alt" href="#benefits">See what’s inside</a></div>
<div class="facts"><span>Free forever</span><span>Private group</span><span>Vetted members</span></div>
</div>
<div class="ledger" aria-label="Example of a month-end close checklist shared in the community">
