</div>
</div></section>

<section class="alt-bg"><div class="wrap">
<h2>AI is changing accounting. Don’t figure it out alone.</h2>
<p>Tasks that took days now take minutes. Roles that felt safe are shifting. The professionals who adapt fastest are the ones learning together.</p>
<div class="grid g3" style="margin-top:28px">
<div class="card"><h3>Learn</h3><p>AI workflows, automation playbooks and real case studies from people who use them at work. No theory, no fluff.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Connect</h3><p>Meet accountants, auditors, CFOs and FP&A people who get your day-to-day. Ask questions and share wins.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Grow</h3><p>Job leads, mentors from senior leaders and a network that opens doors you didn’t know existed.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section><div class="wrap about">
<div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">YN</div>
<div>
<h2>Built by someone who wanted this community years ago.</h2>
<p>Add the founder’s story here: years of experience, the problem you saw, and why you started FinHub BD. Two or three honest sentences work best.</p>
<a class="btn alt" href="#">About the founder</a>
</div></div></section>

<section class="alt-bg" id="benefits"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Everything you need to grow, in one community.</h2>
<p>A private, high-signal space for finance people. Here is what members get.</p>
<div class="grid g4" style="margin-top:28px">
<div class="card"><h3>Peer networking</h3><p>Talk with vetted accountants, auditors and finance leaders who understand your work.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>AI tools & workflows</h3><p>Prompts, automation recipes and tool reviews you can use in Excel, Tally and your ERP this week.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Learning resources</h3><p>Technical deep-dives, exam tips and career advice from people one step ahead of you.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Career opportunities</h3><p>Job leads, freelance gigs and project work shared inside the community.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
<h2>A look inside.</h2>
<div class="grid g2" style="margin-top:26px">
<div class="card"><h3>Topic channels</h3><p>Separate spaces for AI & automation, audit, tax & VAT, month-end close, careers and study abroad.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Events & AMAs</h3><p>Regular workshops, live Q&A with industry leaders and peer-led roundtables.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Resource library</h3><p>Checklists, Excel templates and AI prompt libraries contributed by members.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Mentorship pairing</h3><p>Get matched with a senior professional, or mentor the next generation.</p></div>
</div>
<h3 style="margin-top:40px">Tools our members use</h3>
<div class="tools"><span>Excel</span><span>Tally</span><span>QuickBooks</span><span>Xero</span><span>SAP</span><span>NetSuite</span><span>Power BI</span><span>Claude</span></div>
</div></section>

<section class="alt-bg"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Built for finance professionals at every level.</h2>
<p>Every member is vetted, so conversations stay useful.</p>
<div class="grid g3" style="margin-top:28px">
<div class="card"><h3>Finance managers</h3><p>Lead the close, manage teams and keep the books tight.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>CFOs & leaders</h3><p>Share ideas on leadership, systems and scaling a finance team.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>CAs & accountants</h3><p>From audit readiness to technical accounting, solve problems together.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>FP&A analysts</h3><p>Forecasting, budgeting and business partnering with people who live in the data.</p></div>
