<div class="card"><h3>BBA & CSE students</h3><p>Early-career learners who want practical skills before their first job.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="how"><div class="wrap">
<h2>From application to your first chat in 48 hours.</h2>
<div class="steps" style="margin-top:36px">
<div class="card"><h3>Apply</h3><p>Fill a short form about your background, your role and what you want from the community.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Get vetted</h3><p>We review every application to keep quality high. Expect a reply within 48 hours.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Join the group</h3><p>Get your invite, introduce yourself and start connecting. No fees, no catch.</p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="alt-bg" id="faq"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:780px">
<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
<details><summary>Is it really free?</summary><p>Yes. Membership is free for vetted accounting and finance professionals and students. No fees and no upsells.</p></details>
<details><summary>Who is in the community?</summary><p>Accountants, auditors, finance managers, CFOs, FP&A analysts, bookkeepers and students, from fresh graduates to 20-year veterans.</p></details>
<details><summary>What happens inside the group?</summary><p>Members ask questions, share templates and AI workflows, post job leads and join events. Think of it as your professional brain trust.</p></details>
<details><summary>Is this a job board?</summary><p>No. It is a professional community first. Job leads are a benefit of being connected to good people.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do I need a CA, ACCA or CMA to join?</summary><p>No. We look for committed people in accounting and finance, and students who want to learn.</p></details>
<details><summary>How is it moderated?</summary><p>Every member is vetted, moderators are active, and spam or unprofessional behavior is not allowed.</p></details>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap"><div class="final">
<h2>Your next career step starts with the right community.</h2>
<p>Join accounting and finance professionals who are learning, connecting and growing together. Membership is free.</p>
<a class="btn join" href="#">Apply to join</a>
</div></div></section>
